W3  NON-ADAPTED.  Exact redistribution (a general orthogonal shell decomposition):
        <Lf,f> = sum_l <P_l f, L P_l f>  +  cross(f),   cross = sum_{l!=l'} <P_l f, L P_l' f>
    The redistribution is a BOUND iff  min_{f perp Omega, ||f||=1} f^T M f >= Delta,
